id: cosmic-efficiency
name: Cosmic Efficiency
category: body
importance: secondary
description: >
  You have absolute control of the flow of Ki throughout your body. This natural affinity allows you to use your Ki in
  the most effective and efficient way.
text: >
  (1)-[Passive]: You may use your Magic Modifier instead of your Force Modifier when calculating Surgency (see -
  Surges).
  (2)-[Passive]: Reduce the Ki Point Cost of all your Attacking Maneuvers by 2(T).
  (3)-[Passive]: Increase the Dice Score of your Combat Recovery by 1d6(T).

---

# (1) The higher of the two - "you may use" is never a reason to take the lower one.
[passive]
allow surgency.magic;
attack.kiCost -= 2(T);

# (3) Combat Recovery's Life and Ki Points, 1d6(T) more each use - out of sequence too.
[automatic/declare-maneuver]
if (using("combat-recovery")) {
    life.value += 1d6(T);
    ki.value += 1d6(T);
}
